"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A picture of golden apple growing on an oak tree.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><i><big>\"OMG! IT'S GOLD\"</big></i>\n</p><p>The Golden apple is an item that can be found on <a href=\"/wiki/Oak\" title=\"Oak\">Oak</a> trees ranging from 1/1000 chance to spawn in place of a normal apple. Can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a> for $2,500.\n</p><p>The <b>Golden Apple</b> can also be turned into jam using the <a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a> and sold for $10,000 per jar.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Fruits_Nav\" title=\"Template:Fruits Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Fruits_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Fruits_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\"